  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider a block and trolley system as shown in figure. If the coefficient of kinetic friction between the trolley and the surface is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn></math>, the acceleration of the system in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is: (Consider that the string is massless and unstretchable and the pulley is also massless and frictionless) :</p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3487bb0b-f120-4a0e-9b19-387d61aaaa96.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 253px;\"/>",
