  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3487bb0b-f120-4a0e-9b19-387d61aaaa96.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 253px;\"/></p><p>Maximum kinetic friction acting, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.04</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> Newton</p><p>Therefore, acceleration of the system will be<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>26</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
